Varlatch is licensed by directory:

  AGPL-3.0-or-later
    services/varlatchd/   the Secret Plane daemon
    apps/web/             the dashboard
    convex/               the Application Plane functions

  Apache-2.0
    everything else, including apps/cli/, packages/, infra/, scripts/,
    and docs/

Every source file names its license in an SPDX-License-Identifier header,
and every package directory has a LICENSE file with the full text. Both
full texts are also in LICENSES/.

A Varlatch release also contains and runs third-party components under
their own licenses. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md lists them. Among them, the
Convex backend is source-available under FSL-1.1-Apache-2.0, not open
source.
